flowchart LR
    U[Brand user asks a question in the platform] --> G[Gateway: verify token, tenant comes from token only]
    G --> R[Retrieve that brand's documents and recent performance]
    R --> P{Task type}
    P -- Narrow: classify, extract, templated ad advice --> L[Tuned open-weight model with the brand adapter on vLLM]
    P -- Hard or customer-facing --> H[Premium API model, with brand context only]
    L --> O[Answer with sources shown, no content in logs]
    H --> O
    L -. adapter fails to load .-> B[Fallback: base model with few-shot examples]
    B --> O
